       "id": 31,
       "by": "Test builder",
       "handle": "test-builder",
       "body": "My first car with a driver who fits. Step 3 is where the doors go on, and I am still not sure about the hinges: https://brickworks.diy/app?view=DocsSprt01&step=3\n\n@mira-builds, you did a van with doors like these, how did you hold them?",
       "at": "2026-10-06T10:00:00Z",
       "first": true,
       "answers": null,
       "photo": null,
       "mine": false,
       "hidden": false,
       "hidden_by": null,
       "edited_at": null,
       "by_house": false,
       "by_starter": true
      },
      {
       "id": 33,
       "by": "Mira Okafor",
       "handle": "mira-builds",
       "body": "Clips on the door and a bar in the frame: they swing and stay put. Try 2 x 2 hinge bricks one plate lower and the doors close flush.",
       "at": "2026-10-06T18:22:00Z",
       "first": false,
       "answers": 31,
       "photo": null,
       "mine": false,
       "hidden": false,
       "hidden_by": null,
